{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Now come.</b> To them, for the prophet was astonished at their sitting." "<b>And on a book inscribe it.</b> Written חקה with rafe. And there are codices with a he with mappiq, and behold it is in the language of command, and the full form is חוקקה or חוקקה or חקקנה with a nun."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:57.974980541Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}